; 2026 transactions. Uncomment and edit the examples below, or delete them.
; Add a file per year (2027.ledger, ...) and include it in main.ledger.
; See docs/ledger-cheatsheet.md for more patterns.

; Declares the accounts so Paisa's editor can check this file on its own
include accounts.ledger

; Starting balances: what the household has and owes on day one
; 2026/01/01 Opening balances
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing                4,000.00 CAD
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Savings                10,000.00 CAD
;     Assets:Home                             750,000.00 CAD
;     Liabilities:Mortgage                   -450,000.00 CAD
;     Equity:OpeningBalances

; Partner A's paycheque, deposited to the joint account
; 2026/01/15 Employer A | Pay period ending Jan 15
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing                2,600.00 CAD
;     Expenses:Tax:Income:PartnerA                620.00 CAD
;     Expenses:Tax:CPP:PartnerA                   210.00 CAD
;     Expenses:Tax:EI:PartnerA                     60.00 CAD
;     Income:Salary:PartnerA                   -3,490.00 CAD

; Mortgage payment: split principal and interest from the lender's statement
; 2026/02/01 Bank | Mortgage payment
;     Liabilities:Mortgage                      1,400.00 CAD
;     Expenses:Housing:MortgageInterest         1,100.00 CAD
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing

; Canada Child Benefit (tax-free, paid monthly)
; 2026/01/20 CRA | Canada Child Benefit
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing                  650.00 CAD
;     Income:Benefits:CCB

; Daycare (keep receipts: childcare expenses are deductible)
; 2026/01/31 Daycare | January
;     Expenses:Child:Childcare                    500.00 CAD
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing

; RESP contribution; the 20% CESG grant arrives later
; 2026/01/31 RESP contribution
;     Assets:Investments:RESP:Child               208.33 CAD
;     Assets:Bank:Joint:Chequing
; 2026/03/15 CESG grant
;     Assets:Investments:RESP:Child                41.67 CAD
;     Income:Benefits:RESPGrant
